  "description": "Dive into Coffee Stack - available for free download and quick installation. Completely secure with no threats or malware. Always have effortless access to the newest version.",
  "editor_review": "Are you passionate about coffee? Prepare for an exhilarating journey with Coffee Stack! This captivating cup stacking game merges the excitement of running a coffee shop with the challenge of arranging cups. Gather a variety of coffee cup flavors, stack them high, and sell to your patrons for cash rewards. Enhance your line to convert regular cups into delightful beverages such as cappuccinos and frappuccinos. Personalize your cups with charming lids and gorgeous sleeves to craft artistic coffee cup creations. Construct and embellish your very own coffee shop and build it into a successful caffeine haven. Get set to serve the ultimate cup of coffee!",
